    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "(02.09.2025) Petitioners, through the medium of this petition, seek direction upon the respondents,\nmore particularly respondent No. 4-Collector Land Acquisition, Gool, to conclude the land acquisition proceedings with regard to their land measuring 04 Kanals 13 Marlas, situated at Village Bandhan (Sangaldan), Tehsil Gool, District Ramban, which has been used for the construction of Primary Health Centre Building Sangaldan without payment of compensation to the petitioners/owners.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 429,
      "end": 914,
      "entities": [
        {
